l duration-300"><span class="text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold font-serif text-neutral-900 mb-2">5+</span><span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-neutral-500">Certifications</span></div></div></section><div class="max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-6 sm:px-12 lg:px-16 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-16 mb-24"><div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-16"><section><h3 class="text-xl font-bold font-serif mb-8 text-neutral-900 flex items-center gap-3"><svg class="text-blue-600" fill="none" height="20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="20"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"></polyline></svg>Career Journey</h3><div class="relative pl-6 border-l-2 border-neutral-100 space-y-10"><div class="relative"><div class="absolute -left-[31px] top-1 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-white border-4 border-blue-500 shadow-sm"></div><span class="text-xs font-bold text-blue-600 uppercase tracking-widest mb-1 block">2023</span><h4 class="text-base font-bold text-neutral-900 mb-1">Started B.Tech</h4><p class="text-sm text-neutral-600">Began formal Computer Science engineering education.</p></div><div class="relative"><div class="absolute -left-[31px] top-1 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-white border-4 border-blue-500 shadow-sm"></div><span class="text-xs font-bold text-blue-600 uppercase tracking-widest mb-1 block">2024</span><h4 class="text-base font-bold text-neutral-900 mb-1">Published Books</h4><p class="text-sm text-neutral-600">Authored 4 technical textbooks via Guru-Shishya Publication.</p></div><div class="relative"><div class="absolute -left-[31px] top-1 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-white border-4 border-blue-500 shadow-sm"></div><span class="text-xs font-bold text-blue-600 uppercase tracking-widest mb-1 block">2025</span><h4 class="text-base font-bold text-neutral-900 mb-1">Google Developer Community</h4><p class="text-sm text-neutral-600">Led Event Scape at GDG On Campus, impacting 500+ students.</p></div><div class="relative"><div class="absolute -left-[31px] top-1 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-white border-4 border-blue-500 shadow-sm"></div><span class="text-xs font-bold text-blue-600 uppercase tracking-widest mb-1 block">2026</span><h4 class="text-base font-bold text-neutral-900 mb-1">Cybersecurity Internship</h4><p class="text-sm text-neutral-600">Gained hands-on offensive security experience at Edunet.</p></div><div class="relative"><div class="absolute -left-[31px] top-1 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-white border-4 border-blue-500 shadow-sm"></div><span class="text-xs font-bold text-blue-600 uppercase tracking-widest mb-1 block">Current</span><h4 class="text-base font-bold text-neutral-900 mb-1">Building AI &amp; Full Stack</h4><p class="text-sm text-neutral-600">Developing intelligent web platforms and exploring data analytics.</p></div></div></section><section><h3 class="text-xl font-bold font-serif mb-8 text-neutral-900 flex items-center gap-3"><svg class="text-blue-600" fill="none" height="20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="20"><path d="M22 10v6M2 10l10-5 10 5-10 5z"></path><path d="M6 12v5c3 3 9 3 12 0v-5"></path></svg>Education</h3><div class="space-y-6"><div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border border-neutral-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow"><div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-2"><h4 class="font-bold text-neutral-900">B.Tech in Computer Science</h4><span class="text-xs font-semibold bg-blue-50 text-blue-600 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full whitespace-nowrap">2023 - 2027</span></div><p class="text-sm text-neutral-500 mb-4">IPS Academy, Indore</p><div class="text-sm text-neutral-600"><span class="font-semibold text-neutral-700">Coursework:</span> Data Structures, Algorithms, OOP, Database Management, Computer Networks.</div></div></div></section></div><div class="lg:col-span-7"><section><h3 class="text-xl font-bold font-serif mb-8 text-neutral-900 flex items-center gap-3"><svg class="text-blue-600" fill="none" height="20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="20"><rect height="14" rx="2" ry="2" width="20" x="2" y="7"></rect><path d="M16 21V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16"></path></svg>Professional Experience</h3><div class="space-y-8"><div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl border border-neutral-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow group"><div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-6 gap-4"><div class="flex items-center gap-4"><div class="w-12 h-12 bg-neutral-50 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center p-2 border border-neutral-100"><img alt="Google" class="w-full h-full object-contain" src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/devicons/devicon@latest/icons/google/google-original.svg"/></div><div><h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-neutral-900">Event Scape Lead</h4><p class="text-sm font-medium text-neutral-500">Google Developer Groups (GDG) On Campus</p></div></div><span class="text-xs font-semibold bg-neutral-100 text-neutral-600 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full whitespace-nowrap hidden sm:inline-block">Sept 2024 - Present</span></div><div class="space-y-3 mb-6"><p class="text-sm text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">Organized and managed large-scale technical events and workshops for over 500+ attendees. Coordinated cross-functional teams to ensure seamless event logistics and execution. Spearheaded initiatives to foster a collaborative technical learning environment.</p></div><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 pt-4 border-t border-neutral-50"><span class="px-3 py-1 bg-white border border-neutral-200 text-neutral-600 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider rounded-md">Event Management</span><span class="px-3 py-1 bg-white border border-neutral-200 text-neutral-600 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider rounded-md">Leadership</span><span class="px-3 py-1 bg-white border border-neutral-200 text-neutral-600 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider rounded-md">Tech Community</span><span class="px-3 py-1 bg-white border border-neutral-200 text-neutral-600 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider rounded-md">Logistics</span></div></div><div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl border border-neutral-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow group"><div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-6 gap-4"><div class="flex items-center gap-4"><div class="w-12 h-12 bg-neutral-50 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center border border-neutral-100 overflow-hidden"><img alt="Edunet" class="w-full h-full object-cover" src="/images/vi.png"/></div><div><h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-neutral-900">Cybersecurity Intern</h4><p class="text-sm font-medium text-neutral-500">Edunet Foundation (AICTE)</p></div></div><span class="text-xs font-semibold bg-neutral-100 text-neutral-600 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full whitespace-nowrap hidden sm:inline-block">Mar 2026 - Apr 2026</span></div><div class="space-y-3 mb-6"><p class="text-sm text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">Gained practical exposure to ethical hacking, network security, and forensic packet analysis using Wireshark and Nmap. Conducted phishing simulation exercises to identify organizational vulnerabilities. Documented vulnerability assessment reports for internal review and remediation.</p></div><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 pt-4 border-t border-neutral-50"><span class="px-3 py-1 bg-white border border-neutral-200 text-neutral-600 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider rounded-md">Network Security</span><span class="px-3 py-1 bg-white border border-neutral-200 text-neutral-600 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider rounded-md">Wireshark</span><span class="px-3 py-1 bg-white border border-neutral-200 text-neutral-600 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider rounded-md">Nmap</span><span class="px-3 py-1 bg-white border border-neutral-200 text-neutral-600 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider rounded-md">Ethical Hacking</span></div></div></div></section></div></div><section class="max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-6 sm:px-12 lg:px-16 mb-24"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold font-serif mb-8 text-neutral-900 flex items-center gap-3"><svg class="text-blue-600" fill="none" height="20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="20"><polyline points="16 18 22 12 16 6"></polyline><polyline points="8 6 2 12 8 18"></polyline></svg>Technical Architecture</h3><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6"><div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border border-neutral-100 shadow-sm"><h4 class="font-bold text-neutral-900 mb-4 border-b border-neutral-100 pb-2">Frontend Engineering</h4><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2"><span class="px-3 py-1.5 bg-neutral-50 border border-neutral-100 rounded-lg text-sm text-neutral-700">React</span><span class="px-3 py-1.5 bg-neutral-50 border border-neutral-100 rounded-lg text-sm text-neutral-700">Next.js</span><span class="px-3 py-1.5 bg-neutral-50 border border-neutral-100 rounded-lg text-sm text-neutral-700">Tailwind CSS</span><span class="px-3 py-1.5 bg-neutral-50 border border-neutral-100 rounded-lg text-sm text-neutral-700">JavaScript</span><span class="px-3 py-1.5 bg-neutral-50 border border-neutral-100 rounded-lg text-sm text-neutral-700">TypeScript</span><span class="px-3 py-1.5 bg-neutral-50 border border-neutral-100 rounded-lg text-sm text-neutral-700">GSAP</span></div></div><div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border border-neutral-100 shadow-sm"><h4 class="font-bold text-neutral-900 mb-4 border-b border-neutral-100 pb-2">Backend &amp; Databases</h4><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2"><span class="px-3 py-1.5 bg-neutral-50 border border-neutral-100 rounded-lg text-sm text-neutral-700">Node.js</span><span class="px-3 py-1.5 bg-neutral-50 border border-neutral-100 rounded-lg text-sm text-neutral-700">Express</span><span class="px-3 py-1.5 bg-neutral-50 border border-neutral-100 rounded-lg text-sm text-neutral-700">MongoDB</span><span class="px-3 py-1.5 bg-neutral-50 border border-neutral-100 rounded-lg text-sm text-neutral-700">PostgreSQL</span><span class="px-3 py-1.5 bg-neutral-50 border border-neutral-100 rounded-lg text-sm text-neutral-700">REST APIs</span><span class="px-3 py-1.5 bg-neutral-50 border border-neutral-100 rounded-lg text-sm text-neutral-700">Socket.io</span></div></div><div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border border-neutral-100 shadow-sm"><h4 class="font-bold text-neutral-900 mb-4 border-b border-neutral-100 pb-2">Data &amp; Security</h4><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2"><span class="px-3 py-1.5 bg-neutral-50 border border-neutral-100 rounded-lg text-sm text-neutral-700">Python</span><span class="px-3 py-1.5 bg-neutral-50 border border-neutral-100 rounded-lg text-sm text-neutral-700">Pandas</span><span class="px-3 py-1.5 bg-neutral-50 border border-neutral-100 rounded-lg text-sm text-neutral-700">Data Analytics</span><span class="px-3 py-1.5 bg-neutral-50 border border-neutral-100 rounded-lg text-sm text-neutral-700">Wireshark</span><span class="px-3 py-1.5 bg-neutral-50 border border-neutral-100 rounded-lg text-sm text-neutral-700">Nmap</span><span class="px-3 py-1.5 bg-neutral-50 border border-neutral-100 rounded-lg text-sm text-neutral-700">Security Auditing</span></div></div></div></section><div class="max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-6 sm:px-12 lg:px-16 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-16 mb-24"><section><div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-8"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold font-serif text-neutral-900 flex items-center gap-3"><svg class="text-blue-600" fill="none" height="20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="20"><path d="M4 19.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 17H20"></path><path d="M6.5 2H20v20H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 4 19.5v-15A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 2z"></path></svg>Authored Books</h3><a class="text-s